        {
          "id": "nam-chorus-v1",
          "name": "Default",
          "lyrics": "Neon after midnight\nPainting blue across your face\nWe keep driving past the goodbye\nLike the road can change its place\nNeon after midnight\nOne more block, one more excuse\nIf we never stop the headlights\nI don't have to lose you",
